	<key>readme</key>
	<string>List terminal tabs (default keyword: tt) and AI coding sessions (default keyword: ct), and jump to one.

Enter focuses the tab.

Cmd+Enter copies the session id or folder. Option+Enter copies the resume command.

Closed sessions come after the open ones in the AI sessions list. Enter resumes one in a new tab of your terminal; the first time, pick the terminal and csx Tabs remembers it (change it under Configure Workflow). Ctrl+Enter picks a terminal for that session only.

The workflow calls csx. Install csx first. Set csx_path if csx is not in a standard folder.</string>
